# Shell scripts and Dockerfiles must keep LF endings. A CRLF install.sh fails on
# Linux with "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M", which is a baffling error to
# debug for anyone who clones this from a Windows-authored repo.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
